Add Antigravity as an experimental agent target (`--agent antigravity`, included in `--agent all`), installing skills into `.agents/skills` or `~/.gemini/config/skills`, always-on discoverability rules into `.agents/rules/<skill>.md` or `~/.gemini/config/rules/<skill>.md`, and `type: skill-command` runtime hooks into `.agents/hooks.json` or `~/.gemini/config/hooks.json` with `--antigravity-home` override and manifest-tracked uninstall support. Interactive CLI installs ask before enabling hooks; use `--enable-antigravity-hooks` to approve them in non-interactive installs.
